{"id":"94eb344281b8286a","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator.md","title":"正公式诱导的算术算子","display":"df-positive-arithmetic-operator — 正公式诱导的算术算子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator","aliases":["18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator","18-df-055"],"display":"df-positive-arithmetic-operator — 正公式诱导的算术算子","depends_on":["[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definitions 6.4.1, 6.4.3; Lemma 6.4.4","source_pages":"87–88","source_pdf_pages":"97–98","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator</span><span>18-df-055</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-positive-arithmetic-operator — 正公式诱导的算术算子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definitions 6.4.1, 6.4.3; Lemma 6.4.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"87–88"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"97–98"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span> 只含自由集参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal X\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal X\\)</span> 与自由数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1}\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x,y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1}\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，这些数变量两两不同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec a\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;\\omega\">\\(n&lt;\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(S\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathcal V,\\mathcal X,\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathcal V,\\mathcal X,\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in\\mathcal X\">\\(Y\\in\\mathcal X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bowtie\\in\\{=,\\ne\\}\">\\(\\bowtie\\in\\{=,\\ne\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(F,G\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(v\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Positive}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Positive}_X\\)</span> 按有限公式树递归定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{n,\\vec a}:\\mathcal V\\to\\omega\">\\(\\eta_{n,\\vec a}:\\mathcal V\\to\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_S:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Phi_S:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> 是下式定义的总赋值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}\">\\(\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}\\)</span> 为下式诱导的集合算子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(s\\bowtie t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\top,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(t\\in Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\top,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(t\\notin Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow Y\\ne X,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F\\circ G)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F)\\land\\mathrm{Positive}_X(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(QvF)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(s\\bowtie t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\top,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(t\\in Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\top,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(t\\notin Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow Y\\ne X,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F\\circ G)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F)\\land\\mathrm{Positive}_X(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(QvF)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{n,\\vec a}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v,0\\rangle\\mid v\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x,y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1}\\}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle x,n\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle y_i,a_i\\rangle\\mid i&lt;k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta_{n,\\vec a}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v,0\\rangle\\mid v\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x,y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1}\\}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle x,n\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle y_i,a_i\\rangle\\mid i&lt;k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_S(Y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}S&amp;Y=X,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;Y\\ne X,\\end{cases}\\qquad(Y\\in\\mathcal X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_S(Y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}S&amp;Y=X,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;Y\\ne X,\\end{cases}\\qquad(Y\\in\\mathcal X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{n&lt;\\omega\\mid\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}(A,\\eta_{n,\\vec a},\\Phi_S)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{n&lt;\\omega\\mid\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}(A,\\eta_{n,\\vec a},\\Phi_S)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_A\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{A,\\langle\\rangle}\\qquad(k=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma_A\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{A,\\langle\\rangle}\\qquad(k=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Positive}_X(A)\\longrightarrow\n\\forall S,T\\subseteq\\omega\\;(S\\subseteq T\\to\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(S)\\subseteq\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Positive}_X(A)\\longrightarrow\n\\forall S,T\\subseteq\\omega\\;(S\\subseteq T\\to\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(S)\\subseteq\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核 Definitions 6.4.1、6.4.3 与 Lemma 6.4.4 的证明。Tait 语言的正性由各类原子与逻辑构造的递归方程闭合，不再依赖未定义的子树算子。每个分支缩短公式树，故谓词唯一；数变量互异保证赋值图单值，各分支覆盖 V 和 X 两个变量族，所以满足关系的输入是总赋值。</p>\n<p>单调性按公式结构归纳：只含不涉及 X 的文字时真值不随 S 改变；t∈X 随 S 包含单调；合取、析取与数值量词保持该单调性。旧稿把公式 A(S,n) 直接当集合论真值且 S 无域，现明确标准自然数模型的满足关系及数参数。算子对任意 A 可定义；只有正性条件下才得单调。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 只含自由集参数 $X\\in\\mathcal X$ 与自由数变量 $x,y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1}\\in\\mathcal V$，这些数变量两两不同；$\\vec a\\in\\omega^k$，$n<\\omega$，$S\\subseteq\\omega$。$\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathcal V,\\mathcal X,\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}$ 取 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]。$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}$，$Y\\in\\mathcal X$，$\\bowtie\\in\\{=,\\ne\\}$，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"x,y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1}\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"n<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathcal V,\\mathcal X,\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"\\bowtie\\in\\{=,\\ne\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F,G\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Positive}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_{n,\\vec a}:\\mathcal V\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_S:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(s\\bowtie t)&\\leftrightarrow\\top,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(t\\in Y)&\\leftrightarrow\\top,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(t\\notin Y)&\\leftrightarrow Y\\ne X,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F\\circ G)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F)\\land\\mathrm{Positive}_X(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Positive}_X(QvF)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Positive}_X(F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta_{n,\\vec a}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v,0\\rangle\\mid v\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x,y_0,\\ldots,y_{k-1}\\}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle x,n\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle y_i,a_i\\rangle\\mid i<k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_S(Y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}S&Y=X,\\\\\\varnothing&Y\\ne X,\\end{cases}\\qquad(Y\\in\\mathcal X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}:\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega),\\qquad\n\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\{n<\\omega\\mid\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}(A,\\eta_{n,\\vec a},\\Phi_S)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_A\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{A,\\langle\\rangle}\\qquad(k=0).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Positive}_X(A)\\longrightarrow\n\\forall S,T\\subseteq\\omega\\;(S\\subseteq T\\to\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(S)\\subseteq\\Gamma_{A,\\vec a}(T)).","display":true}],"bytes":3150,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator|18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator|18-df-positive-arithmetic-operator]]"}],"outgoing":["7ddb1b71680edcd2"]}